Subject: [PATCH 05/14] -mforce-l32 as attribute & pragma target("force-l32")

workaround build flags discrepancies, enforcing the l32 in the code itself

nb. as of May 2026, upstream has address space patchset
overall a much better idea, since it attaches force-l32 to the specific
entity for reads / writes and not the full code block
keeping this temporarily, since base upstream syntax is diverged from the
original code for both the target option and insns generation approach
